WEBVTT

00:00:00.640 --> 00:00:03.280
Previously on Yu-Gi-Oh! VRAINS:

00:00:03.280 --> 00:00:06.890
Intruder in the mother computer!

00:00:09.320 --> 00:00:13.360
Redirect Prototype A and B immediately!

00:00:20.280 --> 00:00:22.970
Hey!  That's not fair!

00:00:25.570 --> 00:00:27.840
They're going crazy!

00:00:34.830 --> 00:00:38.250
Hey, AIs?  Stop doing whatever you want.

00:00:38.650 --> 00:00:40.080
Blue Angel!

00:00:41.060 --> 00:00:44.260
I’m the one who'll defeat Playmaker!

00:00:44.260 --> 00:00:46.940
If you interefere, we will eliminate you.

00:00:46.940 --> 00:00:49.640
Oh.  Then I guess I have no choice.

00:00:50.760 --> 00:00:53.090
I’ll take you on!

00:01:08.630 --> 00:01:11.750
I run Across the universe

00:01:11.900 --> 00:01:14.920
At the speed of light

00:01:15.330 --> 00:01:16.790
Begin Loading

00:01:17.030 --> 00:01:20.520
Open the door of dreams

00:01:21.040 --> 00:01:24.090
VRAINS spreads

00:01:24.340 --> 00:01:27.200
Believe in myself

00:01:27.440 --> 00:01:30.730
VRAINS continues

00:01:30.980 --> 00:01:36.040
The circuit draws the future

00:01:36.320 --> 00:01:40.110
I'll grab it with my own hands  Yeah

00:01:40.490 --> 00:01:41.710
Access!

00:01:41.790 --> 00:01:44.410
Start swirling, Data Storm!

00:01:44.690 --> 00:01:46.020
I'm now With the Wind

00:01:46.200 --> 00:01:48.320
Link with my soul

00:01:48.430 --> 00:01:51.090
Speed up, Data Storm!

00:01:51.300 --> 00:01:52.820
Now Win the Race

00:01:52.940 --> 00:01:55.660
Connected world

00:01:55.940 --> 00:01:59.160
No matter when

00:01:59.410 --> 00:02:02.530
Nothing is impossible

00:02:02.750 --> 00:02:06.670
Strive for hope

00:02:06.880 --> 00:02:11.240
And ride the wind!

00:02:30.570 --> 00:02:32.040
Blue Angel…

00:02:32.610 --> 00:02:34.330
Don’t get the wrong idea.

00:02:34.330 --> 00:02:36.570
I only came to repay my debt.

00:02:36.570 --> 00:02:39.130
I don’t recall you owing me.

00:02:39.130 --> 00:02:41.040
That's fine too.

00:02:41.880 --> 00:02:46.170
AI duelist, I’ll take you on!

00:02:46.170 --> 00:02:48.980
I’m the one who'll defeat Playmaker.

00:02:51.460 --> 00:02:54.880
First Playmaker, now Blue Angel?

00:02:58.920 --> 00:03:02.860
Why is Zaizen’s sister 
inside our computers?

00:03:02.860 --> 00:03:05.100
What’s going on?

00:03:05.100 --> 00:03:06.160
Hey!

00:03:06.160 --> 00:03:09.170
Bring Zaizen here immediately!

00:03:09.170 --> 00:03:10.950
He left early today.

00:03:10.950 --> 00:03:14.010
Maybe he’s sick?  Nonsense!

00:03:14.010 --> 00:03:15.960
What should we do, Mr. Kitamura?

00:03:15.960 --> 00:03:19.670
Duel!  Eliminate her immediately!

00:03:19.670 --> 00:03:21.840
Zaizen will be held responsible!

00:03:21.840 --> 00:03:26.320
Prototype B, duel Blue Angel.

00:03:26.320 --> 00:03:27.850
Roger.

00:03:27.850 --> 00:03:29.920
Speed Duel!

00:03:33.000 --> 00:03:36.280
Blue Angel showed up in time.

00:03:36.280 --> 00:03:38.060
Why is Aoi here?

00:03:38.060 --> 00:03:40.000
Emma, is this your doing?

00:03:40.000 --> 00:03:41.800
What are you talking about?

00:03:41.800 --> 00:03:44.810
I won’t let my sister 
do anything dangerous!

00:03:45.330 --> 00:03:46.280
Wait!

00:03:46.890 --> 00:03:51.440
You're giving up this chance to 
learn the truth about ten years ago?

00:03:51.440 --> 00:03:53.320
There’s little time left.

00:03:53.320 --> 00:03:54.640
But Aoi is-

00:03:54.640 --> 00:03:56.400
No “buts”!

00:03:56.400 --> 00:03:59.790
You may think she's a kid, but she's not.

00:04:00.620 --> 00:04:02.220
Let’s go!

00:04:02.220 --> 00:04:06.110
If we don’t hurry, Playmaker 
will get there first.

00:04:11.610 --> 00:04:13.560
It's been a while!  Let's go!

00:04:13.560 --> 00:04:16.160
Understood.  Standby OK.

00:04:16.160 --> 00:04:17.670
My turn!

00:04:17.670 --> 00:04:22.910
From my hand, I activate the Field 
Spell, Trickstar Light Stage!

00:04:22.910 --> 00:04:28.250
I add one Trickstar monster 
in my deck to my hand!

00:04:28.250 --> 00:04:35.490
Since I added this card to my hand without 
drawing it, I can Special Summon Trickstar Lilybell.

00:04:38.760 --> 00:04:43.160
Then I summon Trickstar Candina from my hand!

00:04:44.500 --> 00:04:50.100
Due to Candina’s effect, I add one 
Trickstar card in my deck to my hand!

00:04:50.100 --> 00:04:52.380
Full speed ahead!

00:04:52.380 --> 00:04:56.110
Come out, the circuit of dreams and hope!

00:05:01.450 --> 00:05:06.000
I set Lilybell and Candina 
in the Link Markers!

00:05:06.730 --> 00:05:08.260
Link Summon!

00:05:08.700 --> 00:05:10.880
Appear, Link 2!

00:05:10.880 --> 00:05:13.390
Trickstar Holly Angel!

00:05:18.210 --> 00:05:20.310
Link Summon on the first turn?

00:05:20.310 --> 00:05:26.260
From my hand, I activate the 
spell card, Trickstar Vision!

00:05:27.120 --> 00:05:30.530
Once per turn, I can Special 
Summon a Trickstar from

00:05:30.530 --> 00:05:34.400
my hand by negating its 
effects and halving its ATK!

00:05:34.400 --> 00:05:37.380
C’mon, Trickstar Narkissus!

00:05:39.280 --> 00:05:42.890
Then we both draw a card.

00:05:45.410 --> 00:05:46.360
I draw!

00:05:46.360 --> 00:05:48.200
I'm not done!

00:05:48.200 --> 00:05:50.600
I set one card!

00:05:53.070 --> 00:05:58.210
I use Trickstar Lycoris’s effect 
from my hand on Narkissus!

00:05:58.210 --> 00:06:02.340
She Special Summons herself, and 
Narkissus returns to my hand!

00:06:04.260 --> 00:06:07.250
Now Holly Angel’s effect!

00:06:07.250 --> 00:06:14.220
When a Trickstar is summoned next 
to her link, you take 200 damage!

00:06:14.220 --> 00:06:20.690
And when a Trickstar on my field 
deals you battle or effect damage...

00:06:20.690 --> 00:06:25.540
...Trickstar Light Stage’s 
effect deals you 200 damage!

00:06:27.740 --> 00:06:32.100
And once per turn, when 
you take effect damage...

00:06:32.100 --> 00:06:36.810
...Narkissus is Special 
Summoned from my hand!

00:06:36.810 --> 00:06:39.780
Come back, Trickstar Narkissus!

00:06:39.780 --> 00:06:41.700
In defense position.

00:06:42.880 --> 00:06:46.360
She stings us little by 
little!  How annoying!

00:06:46.360 --> 00:06:48.720
I end my turn!

00:06:49.230 --> 00:06:51.030
My turn!

00:06:51.970 --> 00:06:54.430
Due to Trickstar Lycoris’s effect...

00:06:54.430 --> 00:06:58.400
...when a card is added to your 
hand, you take 200 damage!

00:07:00.640 --> 00:07:07.040
And when a Trickstar on my field 
deals you battle or effect damage...

00:07:07.040 --> 00:07:11.850
...Trickstar Light Stage’s 
effect deals you 200 damage!

00:07:11.850 --> 00:07:16.620
And when a Trickstar deals 
you effect damage...

00:07:16.620 --> 00:07:23.030
...Holly Angel gains ATK equal 
to the effect damage she dealt.

00:07:23.330 --> 00:07:25.270
Holy Blessing!

00:07:27.490 --> 00:07:30.740
How do you like my Trickstar Deck?

00:07:30.740 --> 00:07:32.700
But I can do much more.

00:07:32.700 --> 00:07:35.670
I’ll keep stinging you!

00:07:35.670 --> 00:07:40.400
From my hand, I activate the 
Continuous Spell, Abyss Invitation.

00:07:41.680 --> 00:07:47.880
I pay 500 LP to Special Summon 
Tentacluster Darkwhip from my hand!

00:07:47.880 --> 00:07:51.750
When you activate a monster effect 
from your hand or graveyard...

00:07:51.750 --> 00:07:55.960
...Narkissus’s effect deals you 200 damage!

00:07:56.530 --> 00:07:58.450
Impact on the right knee!

00:07:58.450 --> 00:07:59.660
Down 200 LP!

00:08:00.590 --> 00:08:06.670
When effect damage is 500 or 
less, Abyss Invitation activates!

00:08:06.670 --> 00:08:10.040
Blue Angel takes 200 damage!

00:08:10.040 --> 00:08:11.740
How dare you!

00:08:11.740 --> 00:08:14.480
Light Stage's effect activates!

00:08:16.940 --> 00:08:20.310
And Holy Blessing increases my monster's ATK!

00:08:20.750 --> 00:08:23.080
Abyss Invitation’s effect activates!

00:08:23.080 --> 00:08:27.660
And from my hand, I activate the 
spell card, Machine Duplication!

00:08:28.370 --> 00:08:37.330
From my deck, I Special Summon two copies of 
a Machine on my field with 500 or lower ATK.

00:08:40.300 --> 00:08:41.280
Not bad.

00:08:41.280 --> 00:08:42.720
It's ready!

00:08:42.720 --> 00:08:44.480
Commencing Link Summon!

00:08:46.130 --> 00:08:48.250
Circuit open!

00:08:50.410 --> 00:08:53.610
The summoning conditions 
are three Tentaclusters.

00:08:53.610 --> 00:08:56.560
I set three Darkwhips.

00:09:00.210 --> 00:09:02.220
Link Summon complete.

00:09:04.520 --> 00:09:08.160
Link 3 Tentacluster Nautilus!

00:09:08.160 --> 00:09:10.400
Good!  Wipe her out!

00:09:11.980 --> 00:09:14.610
Tentacluster Nautilus’s effect activates.

00:09:14.610 --> 00:09:22.580
When it's Link Summoned, I Special Summon 
one Tentacluster in my hand next to its link.

00:09:22.580 --> 00:09:26.810
I Special Summon Tentacluster 
Blastsucker from my hand.

00:09:26.810 --> 00:09:30.420
Then I summon another 
Blastsucker from my hand.

00:09:32.410 --> 00:09:37.920
Once per turn, Nautilus can destroy 
a monster that it's linked to.

00:09:37.920 --> 00:09:44.400
And when Blastsucker explodes, 
it deals you 400 damage.

00:09:46.640 --> 00:09:51.600
Due to Abyss Invitation’s 
effect, you take 200 more damage!

00:09:51.610 --> 00:09:57.580
Zaizen’s sister, don't forget that 
it's linked to another Blastsucker.

00:10:01.790 --> 00:10:04.640
Abyss Invitation’s effect!

00:10:05.370 --> 00:10:08.320
You’re going to fight 
me using effect damage?

00:10:08.780 --> 00:10:11.780
Then I’ll stick with that to the end!

00:10:15.710 --> 00:10:19.460
If it’s a slugfest using 
effect damage, I won't lose!

00:10:19.460 --> 00:10:20.800
You fool!

00:10:20.800 --> 00:10:27.820
AI duelists are the best at this strategy!  
Using effect damage to shave away LP!

00:10:29.450 --> 00:10:34.480
I banish one Blastsucker from my 
graveyard to activate its effect.

00:10:35.260 --> 00:10:37.500
You take 400 damage.

00:10:37.500 --> 00:10:39.450
Abyss Invitation’s effect.

00:10:40.040 --> 00:10:45.390
I use Trickstar Narkissus’s 
effect to deal you 200 damage!

00:10:45.860 --> 00:10:47.380
Abyss Invitation!

00:10:47.380 --> 00:10:49.320
Light Stage’s effect!

00:10:49.320 --> 00:10:51.420
Abyss Invitation!

00:10:51.420 --> 00:10:53.400
Holy Blessing!

00:10:55.640 --> 00:10:59.300
Another Blastsucker is in the graveyard.

00:10:59.300 --> 00:11:00.500
Do it!

00:11:00.500 --> 00:11:03.580
I banish Blastsucker from my graveyard.

00:11:04.480 --> 00:11:07.240
Abyss Invitation again!

00:11:07.480 --> 00:11:09.210
Narkissus’s effect!

00:11:09.210 --> 00:11:11.080
Abyss Invitation!

00:11:11.080 --> 00:11:12.920
Light Stage’s effect!

00:11:12.920 --> 00:11:17.660
Due to Abyss Invitation's 
effect, you take 200 damage.

00:11:19.470 --> 00:11:21.630
400 LP…

00:11:24.420 --> 00:11:29.840
Due to Holy Blessing, Holly Angel 
gains ATK equal to the damage.

00:11:32.600 --> 00:11:37.840
From my hand, I activate the Continuous 
Spell, Flexible Tentacluster.

00:11:37.840 --> 00:11:42.550
I Special Summon a banished 
Tentacluster.  Blastsucker!

00:11:46.520 --> 00:11:52.540
Once during each of our turns, Tentacluster 
can make battle damage become 0.

00:11:53.070 --> 00:11:55.400
Good.  This settles it.

00:11:55.400 --> 00:11:58.080
It’s the end for Zaizen’s sister!

00:12:00.890 --> 00:12:05.540
Blastsucker has less ATK than my Lycoris.

00:12:05.540 --> 00:12:12.140
But even if I destroy it, Flexible 
Tentacluster makes the battle damage become 0.

00:12:12.140 --> 00:12:19.560
And by banishing Blastsucker from the 
graveyard, its effect deals 400 damage.

00:12:20.320 --> 00:12:23.180
I only have 400 LP left.

00:12:23.850 --> 00:12:27.990
So it's going to attack, knowing 
that it'll be destroyed.

00:12:27.990 --> 00:12:29.360
Battle!

00:12:29.360 --> 00:12:34.070
Tentacluster Blastsucker 
attacks Trickstar Lycoris!

00:12:35.520 --> 00:12:36.680
I’m going to lose!

00:12:38.270 --> 00:12:39.610
Just kidding!

00:12:39.610 --> 00:12:47.660
I return a Trickstar on my field to my hand 
to activate the trap card, Trickstar Cascade!

00:12:47.660 --> 00:12:51.020
It negates your monster's attack!

00:12:52.820 --> 00:12:55.060
I end my turn.

00:12:57.290 --> 00:13:00.300
Holly Angel’s effect now ends.

00:13:00.300 --> 00:13:02.230
Her ATK returns to normal.

00:13:02.230 --> 00:13:05.000
You won't get another turn!

00:13:06.250 --> 00:13:08.690
My turn!

00:13:09.410 --> 00:13:12.040
Let's continue.  Here I go!

00:13:12.050 --> 00:13:15.940
I banish two Cyberses from my graveyard.

00:13:17.560 --> 00:13:21.420
That activates Dual Assembwurm's 
effect from my graveyard!

00:13:22.260 --> 00:13:26.680
I can Special Summon it by having its ATK!

00:13:34.000 --> 00:13:38.860
And since Dotscaper was banished, 
I can Special Summon it.

00:13:41.080 --> 00:13:48.440
I pay half my LP to activate the Equip Spell 
Cynet Defrag's effect from my graveyard.

00:13:48.440 --> 00:13:54.930
I Special Summon the Cyberse monster Flick 
Clown from my graveyard in defense position.

00:13:57.230 --> 00:14:00.900
I equip Cynet Defrag on Flick Clown!

00:14:02.360 --> 00:14:04.460
Flick Clown’s effect!

00:14:04.970 --> 00:14:08.430
It activates when I have no cards in my hand.

00:14:08.430 --> 00:14:12.030
I pay 1000 LP to draw a card!

00:14:12.030 --> 00:14:14.420
Three monsters and 1000 LP!

00:14:14.420 --> 00:14:16.270
You're ready to go!

00:14:22.740 --> 00:14:25.060
Data abnormality in Area B!

00:14:25.720 --> 00:14:28.680
Exceeding max data in a single point!

00:14:34.060 --> 00:14:38.620
Prototype A and its two monsters 
avoided the abnormality!

00:14:38.620 --> 00:14:41.360
What is going on?

00:14:41.360 --> 00:14:44.920
What monster is hiding inside?

00:14:44.920 --> 00:14:46.810
We have to check it out!

00:14:47.060 --> 00:14:47.970
Let's go!

00:14:52.500 --> 00:14:55.280
Seize the wind, Playmaker!

00:15:18.930 --> 00:15:19.910
Now!

00:15:20.240 --> 00:15:23.810
Activating Skill!  Storm Access!

00:15:27.480 --> 00:15:30.980
Appear!  The circuit that 
leads to the future!

00:15:32.850 --> 00:15:36.880
The summoning conditions 
are at least two Cyberses!

00:15:36.880 --> 00:15:44.060
I set Dotscaper, Dual Assembwurm and 
Flick Clown in the Link Markers!

00:15:45.930 --> 00:15:47.210
Link Summon!

00:15:47.210 --> 00:15:51.380
Appear, Link 3 Vector Square Archfiend!

00:16:00.910 --> 00:16:03.880
Then I summon Cyberse Wizard.

00:16:06.850 --> 00:16:08.210
Let’s end this fast.

00:16:08.210 --> 00:16:09.450
Gladly!

00:16:14.610 --> 00:16:15.960
There's the goal.

00:16:15.960 --> 00:16:16.930
Yeah.

00:16:18.160 --> 00:16:19.390
Battle!

00:16:19.390 --> 00:16:23.130
Cyberse Wizard attacks Drillworm 
in defense position!

00:16:23.130 --> 00:16:25.230
Illusion Spike!

00:16:28.750 --> 00:16:33.570
Vector Square Archfiend attacks 
Tentacluster Nautilus!

00:16:49.190 --> 00:16:51.750
This is my company’s data bank.

00:16:51.750 --> 00:16:54.600
The data from ten years ago is here.

00:16:55.190 --> 00:17:01.310
I tribute Cyberse Wizard to activate 
Vector Square Archfiend's effect!

00:17:01.310 --> 00:17:03.360
Demon Resurrection!

00:17:04.250 --> 00:17:08.770
The monster it destroyed in battle 
is Special Summoned next to its link!

00:17:08.770 --> 00:17:16.250
Vector Square Archfiend can attack your 
monster it Special Summoned again!

00:17:17.720 --> 00:17:19.450
Are you listening?

00:17:19.840 --> 00:17:20.790
Battle!

00:17:21.190 --> 00:17:25.990
Vector Square Archfiend attacks 
Tentacluster Nautilus!

00:17:25.990 --> 00:17:28.100
Diabolic Spin!

00:17:35.230 --> 00:17:37.970
Prototype A has been terminated.

00:17:37.970 --> 00:17:42.140
What are you doing, you idiots!

00:17:42.880 --> 00:17:45.140
I’m far off course.

00:17:45.140 --> 00:17:48.400
I’ll guide you on an 
alternate path.  Hurry.

00:17:48.400 --> 00:17:52.640
I summon Trickstar Candina from my hand!

00:17:52.640 --> 00:17:57.950
Due to her effect, I add one 
card in my deck to my hand!

00:17:57.950 --> 00:18:00.330
Here I go!

00:18:00.330 --> 00:18:04.490
Come out, the circuit of dreams and hope!

00:18:07.960 --> 00:18:10.940
The summoning conditions are two Trickstars!

00:18:10.940 --> 00:18:15.440
I set Narkissus and Lycoris 
in the Link Markers!

00:18:20.910 --> 00:18:22.390
Link Summon!

00:18:26.480 --> 00:18:31.780
Appear, Link 2 Trickstar Black Catbat!

00:18:36.360 --> 00:18:38.340
Holly Angel’s effect!

00:18:38.340 --> 00:18:44.440
Since a Trickstar was summoned next 
to her link, you take 200 damage!

00:18:44.440 --> 00:18:46.670
Abyss Invitation’s effect!

00:18:47.220 --> 00:18:49.640
Holly Angel’s effect!

00:18:49.640 --> 00:18:52.610
She gains ATK equal to the damage!

00:18:52.610 --> 00:18:56.750
200 LP left…  That’s plenty!

00:18:57.490 --> 00:19:00.490
Trickstar Black Catbat’s effect activates!

00:19:00.920 --> 00:19:06.820
When you take damage, for every monster next to her 
link,

00:19:06.820 --> 00:19:11.560
your monsters lose 200 ATK 
until the end of the turn!

00:19:14.310 --> 00:19:19.050
From my hand, I activate the Quick-Play 
Spell, Trickstar Temptation!

00:19:19.530 --> 00:19:22.410
When there’s a Trickstar on my field...

00:19:22.410 --> 00:19:26.170
...a monster whose ATK has changed...

00:19:26.170 --> 00:19:29.350
I'm talking about you, Mr. Blastsucker!

00:19:29.350 --> 00:19:32.090
You return to your owner’s hand!

00:19:32.090 --> 00:19:32.830
Leave!

00:19:36.530 --> 00:19:40.660
Next, Holly Angel attacks 
Tentacluster Nautilus!

00:19:48.110 --> 00:19:54.210
Due to Flexible Tentacluster’s 
effect, battle damage becomes 0!

00:19:54.210 --> 00:19:56.510
I knew you’d do that!

00:19:56.510 --> 00:19:58.180
Ready for this?

00:19:59.410 --> 00:20:01.150
Final battle!

00:20:01.150 --> 00:20:07.790
Trickstar Black Catbat 
attacks AI No. 2 directly!

00:20:22.340 --> 00:20:23.820
Hooray!

00:20:25.070 --> 00:20:26.890
No encores!

00:20:34.830 --> 00:20:36.120
There it is.

00:20:39.740 --> 00:20:43.290
Playmaker infiltrated the data bank?

00:20:43.290 --> 00:20:44.590
Drive him out!

00:20:44.590 --> 00:20:47.340
Umm, but that's not possible.

00:20:47.340 --> 00:20:52.280
No "buts"!  You’re fired!

00:20:52.280 --> 00:20:54.880
Do something!  Something!

00:20:56.400 --> 00:20:58.750
Send Prototype B!

00:20:58.750 --> 00:21:02.270
Blue Angel defeated it, 
so it's not operational.

00:21:02.270 --> 00:21:04.990
You’re fired too!  Fired!

00:21:05.680 --> 00:21:11.540
And I’ll be held responsible 
and be fired too.

00:21:12.170 --> 00:21:15.130
Other intruders inside the data bank!

00:21:16.200 --> 00:21:17.660
What?

00:21:19.420 --> 00:21:20.680
Someone’s coming!

00:21:23.980 --> 00:21:26.650
What are you doing?  Hide!

